  "_note": "Reference ranges used by the NeuroShield Crew Health Monitor. 'normal' = green band, 'warn' = outer limit of the caution (amber) band; values beyond 'warn' are critical (red). null means the side is not bounded. Thresholds are for demonstration and decision support only; they are not medical criteria and must be individualised by flight surgeons.",
